yanHaley","id":6034499,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzQ0OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6034499?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley","html_url":"https://github.com/BryanHaley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BryanHaley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T05:27:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:27:03Z","body":"> I want to support JPEG XL (JXL), but I would like a second opinion if the adding of runtime binary size of the 186_000 lines of code is ok.\r\n\r\nWith decoding only the size increase was negligible. With encoding it's noteworthy but I managed to cut it down by trimming the SIMD code generation. Measured with stripped `production=yes` builds:\r\n\r\n| Target | Without JXL | With JXL | Increase |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| macOS ARM64 release template | 55.8 MB | 57.4 MB | +1.6 MB (2.8%) |\r\n| macOS ARM64 debug template | 57.6 MB | 59.1 MB | +1.4 MB (2.4%) |\r\n| macOS ARM64 editor | 110.1 MB | 111.5 MB | +1.4 MB (1.2%) |\r\n| x86-64 release template (full LTO) | 62.0 MB | 65.5 MB | +3.6 MB (5.7%) |\r\n| Web release (Brotli, download size) | 6.70 MB | 7.03 MB | +0.33 MB (4.9%) |","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6208763461/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6212931243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120276#issuecomment-6212931243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120276","id":6212931243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABclHOqw","user":{"login":"qwertychouskie","id":13989090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg5MDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13989090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie","html_url":"https://github.com/qwertychouskie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qwertychouskie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T09:55:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:55:38Z","body":"Does libjxl support decoding regular JPEGs as well?  Might be able to cut down on total binary size if the JPEG library currently being used is removed in favor of libjxl handling both.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6212931243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6217477981","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120276#issuecomment-6217477981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120276","id":6217477981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcpcvXQ","user":{"login":"jonnyawsom3","id":51539240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTM5MjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51539240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3","html_url":"https://github.com/jonnyawsom3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonnyawsom3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:50Z","body":"Not directly, but you can transcode to JXL losslessly for 20% savings and higher quality results (from higher precision maths and built in dithering), but you can disable the JPEG reconstruction code to save some binary size too.\r\n\r\n> I would like a second opinion if the adding of runtime binary size of the 186_000 lines of code is ok.\r\n\r\nThat's the size of the entire repo, including benchmarks, tests, debug tools, JPEG, PNG, GIF and EXR libraries for the CLI tools.... The actual size of libjxl's en/decoder is substantially smaller, especially when optimised for size instead of speed.\r\nAlso see https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl/issues/3887, SVE and LTO are the main size increases. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6217477981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]